      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَرْضٌ مُسْحَفَةٌ</span></b> , with fet-h [to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ح</span>, or perhaps
to the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ح</span>], <i>A land of which the herbage is
thin</i> [or <i>scanty</i>]: mentioned in the K in art.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سخف</span>, as being [written <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْخِفَةٌ</span>,] like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَحْسِنَةٌ</span>.
(TA.)

